# Pipeline backup snapshots (transient). Scripts write these before a
# destructive pass; they are recoverable from git history, so they do not
# belong in the working tree — 330 MB of them were removed 2026-08-18, which
# every Streamlit Cloud checkout was paying for.
# Two are genuine script INPUTS, not snapshots, so they stay tracked:
#   core_db.tsv.pre_canonical_backup  (read by build_canonical_mapping_tsv.py)
#   core_db.tsv.pre_arne_2026-06-28   (read by apply_arne_decisions.py)
*.pre_*
*_pre_explode_backup.tsv
*_pre_explode_qid_backup.tsv
*.preconflict_bak
*.bak
!Zylbercweig/organizations/core_db.tsv.pre_canonical_backup
!Zylbercweig/organizations/core_db.tsv.pre_arne_2026-06-28
